      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ha, I am more than willing to find that out later.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "This\u2026 This is something I feel I must do.\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: Santi, listen to me. Once I am inside, I might not be able to contact
        you for a while. At least, until the confrontation is over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'I promise I will tell you everything when I am able to.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
