    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: I can certainly try.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: "<SFX_liezel_thinking><i>(Hm... Perhaps I can give that <b>manuscript
        at my home</b> another look\u2014there were definitely similar looking symbols
        written there.)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: "<i>(... So far, all of our clues have been pointing at Servillano trying
        to tell someone something. That \u201Csomeone\u201D being my sister if I
        had to guess.)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[3]'
      value: "<i>(Is it possible that Ate Lorena leaving town... wasn\u2019t a coincidence?)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
