      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: "<SFX_liezel_wondering><i>(An old photo of the <b>leaders of the Disidensiya</b>.
        From the looks of it, this must have been taken a few years ago by now. That\u2019s
        <b>Servillano</b> in front... So it must be Rommel on the left.)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(I do hope they are not involved in this mess.)</i>
