    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: You are dismissed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: If you do not hear orders from my mouth or under my name, do not act
        on anything. I will handle disseminating this information to my peers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: "The times have changed. Giyala no longer holds stability on its own,
        unlike before. We must gather as much power as we can get. Our competence
        will keep us grounded.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: 2e6185c7e5dbb4c4989dcb38e25cdcb4, type: 3}
