      value: "<SFX_liezel_wondering><i>(This is the manual for the press. There\u2019s
        a note on it that says \u201CTo all future users of the printing press\u2026
        Please read\u201D.)</i>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5654484641697981369, guid: 0d0aec03b4a2e4eebac4d306d494957c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(Haha, there must have been accidents before.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
